Z||000000||87 Pegasus||07-01-2001||12:34 AM||||I would like to say something.  I was at a car show a weekend ago, and I had my display looking nice.  When the show ended, I packed my things to go home.  It wasn't until about a week later, I noticed something terribly wrong.  Someone had stolen pictures from my photo album.  I have no clue who took it, and I know that my fellow club members would not want these pictures seeing as they have thousands on their own, but what does that have to say about life in general?  Do I now have to stand guard at my car and not enjoy the other toys that have come out to play?  I mean, how wrong is that?  Has this happened to anyone else...and now what do I do? <P>------------------<BR>Friends don't let friends drive Corvettes!!||||reg||1
Z||000001||KissMySSFiero||07-01-2001||12:38 AM||||sorry to hear that.  that is kinda pathetic if you ask me.  i dont understand why someone would want to steal other people pictures.  i bet if you walk into their house,  they have pictures on the walls of the "other people"   you know the ones that come in the picture frames when you buy them.  <BR>its sad when you have to babysit your car when your at a show.<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>      <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>       <P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">           <BR>"Kids in the backseat cause accidents,  accidents in the backseat caused me!!"||||reg||1
Z||000002||87 Pegasus||07-01-2001||01:07 PM||||i know you should not have to babysit your car at car shows...  it all comes back to what your parents tell you when you break something... "WE JUST CAN"T HAVE NICE THINGS ANYMORE..."  so what now can not have any displays on the car for fear of someone taking it?  that is just wrong...  For people to do that they must not have a life..if you ask me... Maybe i should get one of those little spy cams.  :-)  or put up a little baracade around the car with added signs saying "TOUCH AND DIE!!"  Or there's always guard dogs.<P>------------------<BR>Friends don't let friends drive Corvettes!!||||reg||3
